  "description": "*Maps for Blazor* is a library that provides components for displaying maps in Blazor applications. It supports various map providers (Esri, Leaflet) and allows developers to easily integrate interactive maps into their Blazor projects. One code, one component,  many technologies.\nKEYWORDS: Minimizing Invoke callers to JavaScript, No JavaScript specific settings, no script references, no css links. One code, one component many technologies.",
